# Staged local inference assets — regenerated by `npm install`.
#
# Both are build inputs produced by scripts/prepare-assets.mjs: the WASM runtime is
# copied out of node_modules, and the model is downloaded once from Google's public
# MediaPipe bucket. Keeping them out of git avoids committing ~38 MB of third-party
# binaries that the install step restores anyway.
#
# Air-gapped or offline installs: delete these two lines and commit the files so a
# clone needs no network at all. See the README's "Assets and licensing" section.
public/mediapipe/
public/models/

